.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-ZFS 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-zfs
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's zfs plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP zfs
\fBplugin\fP zfs {
    \fBcollect\fP \fIflags\fP
}
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBzfs\fP plugin collects information about the Adaptive Replacement
Cache (ARC) of the Zeta File-System (ZFS).
It reports information such as the cache size, the various hits and misses
and the transferred data.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \fBcollect\fP \fIflags\fP
Select which statistics to collect.
A flag can be negated with a leading \fB!\fP, \fBall\fP selects all the flags.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \fBabdstats\fP
ABD (ARC buffer data) statistics.
.It \fBarcstats\fP
ARC statistics. Enabled by default.
.It \fBdbufstats\fP
DMU buffer statistics.
.It \fBdmu_tx\fP
DMU transaction statistics.
.It \fBdnodestats\fP
Dnode statistics.
.It \fBfm\fP
Fault management statistics.
.It \fBqat\fP
Intel QuickAssist Technology statistics.
.It \fBvdev_cache_stats\fP
Vdev cache statistics.
.It \fBvdev_mirror_stats\fP
Vdev mirror statistics.
.It \fBxuio_stats\fP
XUIO statistics.
.It \fBzfetchstats\fP
Prefetch statistics.
.It \fBzil\fP
ZFS Intent Log statistics.
.It \fBstate\fP
Pool state.
.It \fBio\fP
Pool I/O statistics.
.It \fBobjset\fP
Dataset statistics.
.El
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
